<title>USA: Mueller completes deal to buy Desnoyers.</title>
<headline>Mueller completes deal to buy Desnoyers.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mueller Industries Inc said Tuesday it has completed a deal to acquire Desnoyers SA, a French copper tube manufacturer.</p>
<p>Mueller said it acquired Desnoyers for $13.5 million in cash and will account for the transaction as a purchase.</p>
<p>Mueller is a diversified multinational metal and plastics fabricator.</p>
</text>
